      "value": "Can you provide some more details? If you have output logs for the issue, please send them over to our Support team and link this issue.\nYou can find your output log at C:\\Users\\%Username%\\AppData\\LocalLow\\VRChat\\vrchat named output_log.txt\nFeel free to also add videos of the issue if you think it'd be relevant.",
