      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hello..\nI'm also having a new movement issue. Whenever I move around, I would walk really slow, as if I'm in slow motion. It happens every second or two in between normal speed walking so it makes the game near unplayable.. very frustrating.\nI tried restarting the game, SteamVR, my computer itself, rerun room setup, plug in and out my base stations, tried using different avatars (including default VRChat ones), tried switching my left and right controllers, etc..\nNothing. I feel this is related to the new patch because I was able to play just fine last evening.\nPlease resolve ASAP, thank you..",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
