      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "UPDATE\nFound a work around.. for some reason, I need to turn on and off an option called 'Advanced Vive Control' under setting in VRChat. But I need to do this every time when I first boot up VRChat. Reinstalling VRChat and SteamVR did not fix.\nIn conclusion, there must be a coding/bug within VRChat that assumes I always have Advanced Vive Control on.. even when it's checked off when I first login to the game.\nPlease fix this issue soon, thank you.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
