      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Video demo (thumbstick deadzone set to 50%): https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/356920171480481804/855127287200219146/20210617_164815_MixedReality.mp4\nIt seems that with the latest VRChat update, the game ignores your SteamVR deadzone setting and moves you forward if it's within the deadzone. Scrolling menus through the joystick still functions as expected.",
